      en: ["The park was officially established in 1991.", "The Do Quyen Waterfall has a vertical drop of approximately 300 meters.", "Over 1,400 plant species have been identified within the national park.", "The park hosts about 330 species of birds, making it a center for ornithologists.", "Annual rainfall can reach up to 8,000 mm in some years.", "Vong Hai Dai is the name of the observation post at the mountain's summit."],
